  "description": {
   "en": "Meet S'more Milwalky, a genius scientist at Deslike Prison, otherwise known as Dead End Prison. S'more has been grinding away nonstop with research and work, leaving her little chance to fall in love. However, one fateful day, when the executed assassin known as \"Painkiller\" is brought into her lab, S'more accidentally uses her Secret Elixer on him...",
   "ja": "殺し屋の俺は、殺人の罪で処刑されたはずだった…。スモア・ミルウォーキーの天才的な手術（エンバーミング）によって、死（death）から蘇生した凶悪犯＝デッド・ペインキラー。彼はまだ、これから我が身に降りかかる、ほんとう（？）の愛（オーバーキル）を知らない…。純白は赤き血（愛）に染まる―。"
  },
